# USB_C_Receptacle_HRO_TYPE-C-31-M-12_JLC -- KiCad's USB_C_Receptacle_HRO_TYPE-C-31-M-12 (KiCad 7 library) with
# the footprint origin moved to the origin of JLCPCB's library footprint of the part (LCSC C165948, EasyEDA
# "USB-C_SMD-TYPE-C-31-M-12_1"). JLCPCB places the part with ITS footprint at the CPL position, so the two origins have
# to be the same point: every pad, hole, line and text is 1.53 mm further in +y (toward the mouth) than in KiCad's
# footprint (pad sizes, holes and numbers are KiCad's). One change besides: the silkscreen line across the mouth is
# left out and the two side lines end 0.5 mm before the mouth (KiCad's run 0.25 mm past it), because the mouth stands
# at the board's top edge (rev H) and the board edge would cut them off.
# The offset is the mean y offset of the 16 EasyEDA pads from their KiCad pads: 12 signal pads, four of them named
# for two pins each ("A1B12" = KiCad's A1 and B12 on one spot), and the four shell pads "1"-"4" = KiCad's "S1". The
# signal pads alone are 1.57 mm off, the shell pads 1.42 mm. After the move every EasyEDA pad centre lies within
# 0.11 mm of its KiCad pad centre (tests/check_footprints_easyeda.py; check_cpl.py allows 0.40 mm).
# The pin names stay KiCad's (A1, B12, S1, ...): the CPL check needs a name map for this part.
(footprint "USB_C_Receptacle_HRO_TYPE-C-31-M-12_JLC" (version 20211014) (generator famicart)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "USB Type-C receptacle for USB 2.0 and PD, HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12 (LCSC C165948): KiCad's USB_C_Receptacle_HRO_TYPE-C-31-M-12 with its origin moved to the origin of JLCPCB's library footprint (USB-C_SMD-TYPE-C-31-M-12_1), all items 1.53 mm further in +y; http://www.krhro.com/uploads/soft/180320/1-1P320120243.pdf")
  (tags "usb usb-c 2.0 pd")
  (attr smd)
  (fp_text reference "REF**" (at 0 -4.115) (layer "F.SilkS")
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (fp_text value "USB_C_Receptacle_HRO_TYPE-C-31-M-12" (at 0 6.63) (layer "F.Fab")
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (fp_text user "${REFERENCE}" (at 0 1.53) (layer "F.Fab")
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (fp_line (start 4.7 -0.37) (end 4.7 1.63) (layer "F.SilkS") (width 0.12))
  (fp_line (start -4.7 3.53) (end -4.7 4.68) (layer "F.SilkS") (width 0.12))
  (fp_line (start -4.7 -0.37) (end -4.7 1.63) (layer "F.SilkS") (width 0.12))
